{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "3850258362478acd5406f8666ee6c2f039605e6a53334ef1a9ddc01cc81cca6f", "ja": "オープニングセレモニー", "zh": "开幕仪式", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6000_place", "source_sha256": "91c445b89bf2e9cc7a09da5c85d789d03e1fa5760c0f819b2a07c35df0a2c071", "ja": "ドッグカフェ", "zh": "狗狗咖啡厅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6001_p", "source_sha256": "70cb965d36b2174f9e09be854a2c072d222e2f803121ae4ce555188016031be7", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\n犬たちと共演する予定だ。もうすぐ本番だけど……）", "zh": "（今天要在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄中和狗狗们合作，马上就要正式开拍了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6002_002chi", "source_sha256": "3b74fb4f9d3c817a2af0bb85899b15d8b26ac16c28737baa2c572d7d2ba67b2c", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしました。\n髪を直してきました。これで、大丈夫でしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，让您久等了。\n我去整理了一下头发。这样，没问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6003_p", "source_sha256": "216eabc34db002d79bc3dde20d4048bec7c8043e1680b9727565b9821eb7d4d6", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だ。さっきは大変だったな。\n衣装に着替えて早々、犬たちに囲まれて。", "zh": "啊，没问题。刚才辛苦你了。\n才刚换好服装，就被狗狗们围住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6004_002chi", "source_sha256": "c0b67a1cae9e96d1ef13070be1be9f86b462dadae933cf1f76a1a97c0cdc50e4", "ja": "はい。人懐っこい子ばかりで。初対面なのに、\n人見知りしないなんて、すごいですね。", "zh": "是的，都是很亲人的孩子。明明是第一次见面，却一点都不怕生，真厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6005_p", "source_sha256": "1bdd22ec7de2626b908adaa774d8fb2c28bd4db9211af5cb729de2bd2a6fdb47", "ja": "ああ。犬の耳としっぽを付けてるから、\n千早のことも友達だと思ったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "啊。可能是因为千早戴着狗耳朵和尾巴，所以它们把千早也当成朋友了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6006_002chi", "source_sha256": "1fef0e894ff99f16b11f83cfb5dcc8b31c3961f8446bfa988b6bf5396ad5ab9e", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。ただ、少し気になることが……。\n一匹だけ、隅でじっとしている子がいるんです。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。不过，有件事让我有些在意……有一只一直待在角落里，一动不动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6007_002chi", "source_sha256": "ff3d1a9701c0e8b03481cdda9fef0e5c3a85e77ad9d7dbe250080f840988111c", "ja": "みんながみんな、大勢の人の前でいきなり馴染めるわけ\nではないですから……。気持ちはわかる気がします。", "zh": "并不是谁都能一下子适应在这么多人面前的……\n我感觉自己能理解它的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6008_002chi", "source_sha256": "38e56f0acfa7eaa42e266821b4f0b3f6c9b68326c7d06db0982b78ae9ffbdab5", "ja": "でも、できれば……あの子とも打ち解けたいです。\n何か、いい方法はないでしょうか？", "zh": "但是，如果可以的话……我也想和那孩子熟悉起来。\n有没有什么好办法呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6009_p", "source_sha256": "eb0c397b303631bd7bbdcd3304f04936345d44b4598af594fc4ec2c9fa079040", "ja": "うーん、そうだな。\nそれなら……。", "zh": "嗯——让我想想。\n那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6010", "source_sha256": "410ea28dfb07633fedbc8a0fd0827bedd431f90130879ba58ca33cf220b092f9", "ja": "そばにいる", "zh": "陪在身边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6011", "source_sha256": "ea462cfbd7f1d6aacc2124228c51de1d29415c760b879aeff7226a008589c0c8", "ja": "歌声ヒーリング", "zh": "歌声疗愈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6012", "source_sha256": "fe72604f6b36a94dd9581a32c24918caa6bd169a8f34860606d9e4de266c8bbe", "ja": "犬のモノマネをする", "zh": "模仿狗叫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6100_p", "source_sha256": "3be324ed4b749185b572ce94b6ca82ff1c28a185b66c3dac5336eb5c2dd10c0e", "ja": "まずは、人に慣れてもらうために、\n千早がそばにいてあげるのはどうだ？", "zh": "为了先让它习惯人类，\n千早陪在它身边怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6101_002chi", "source_sha256": "7be09761ca5054be675949d97847b5f5431e92369ea8825b6ce164d3fcf55db6", "ja": "そうですね。私も、それがいいと思います。\nそばに誰かがいてくれた方が、安心するかと。", "zh": "是啊，我也觉得这样比较好。身边有人陪着的话，应该会更安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6102_002chi", "source_sha256": "c234d01da6109943f592eabff89bcd5c8e11a9888c9c226a10390398be60d09a", "ja": "では、撮影が始まるまで、\nあの子に寄り添っていますね。ふふ。", "zh": "那么，在拍摄开始前，\n我会陪在那孩子身边。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6200_p", "source_sha256": "d4141b64c970767166a0e40fca2675726d744c1eb0306b2a47b092f7a0f58872", "ja": "犬用のヒーリング音楽っていうのもあるみたいだし、\n千早の歌声でリラックスさせるのはどうかな？", "zh": "听说还有给狗听的疗愈音乐，要不要用千早的歌声让它放松一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6201_002chi", "source_sha256": "785b24958a3fc1a1507986612b53f00045696ad8e581e5d297d8916597b0bc46", "ja": "なるほど、いいかもしれません。リラックス\nさせるなら……やっぱり、子守歌でしょうか。", "zh": "原来如此，或许可行。要让它放松的话……果然还是摇篮曲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6202_p", "source_sha256": "0dab313c0e268a3dd749a7b85c6f981f33e98b6be9dec872d038caa0ce24b2c8", "ja": "子守歌か……。そうだな。リラックスしてくれるとは\n思うけど、眠ってしまったら大変だぞ。", "zh": "催眠曲啊……也是呢。虽然觉得确实能让人放松下来，\n但要是睡着了可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6203_002chi", "source_sha256": "0129b65da34e8f18e81de3d8167547212cd5264549576957f08e5f3d0ace8bcf", "ja": "あ、そうですね。眠るまではしない程度に……。\nでは、童謡とか、ゆったりした感じの歌にしてみます。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。那就选不会让人睡着，但又能让人放松的程度……。\n那么，试试童谣之类节奏舒缓的歌曲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6300_p", "source_sha256": "9fcf21faa65792bb20367111150e6fb4256cca9583a48330fe1ca2dc0d860568", "ja": "犬のモノマネをするのはどうだ？　犬の仲間だと\n思わせれば、打ち解けてくれるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "模仿狗叫怎么样？要是让它以为我们是同类，说不定就会和我们亲近起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6301_002chi", "source_sha256": "8232486eed988dccc10b6461360330d7722ca89273ad0cbe712e492b8bd74e31", "ja": "モノマネ、ですか……？　わかりました。\nでは、練習をさせてください。", "zh": "模仿吗……？我明白了。\n那么，请让我练习一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6302_002chi", "source_sha256": "24af22588ceedcaf47567cf4442ee3f64faf16e45be0a02817fd9a66cb56a8e1", "ja": "ワンワン！　ワン！　ワオ～ン！\n……どうでしょうか？", "zh": "汪汪！汪！汪呜——！\n……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_6303_002chi", "source_sha256": "cd2fce7b260c7d680784fb6cf6524c502c0a9a0e1ddd23943a3f743874745bd7", "ja": "え、仕草も真似た方が……。そこまでする必要が……？\nいえ、嫌というわけでは。少し、恥ずかしくて……。", "zh": "诶，连动作也要模仿吗……有必要做到那种程度吗……？\n不，也不是讨厌。只是有点害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
